ationModule\/Simulation","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Simulation"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Simulation"}]},"doc://ECS/documentation/ECS/GettingStarted":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Define components, spawn entities, and move them with systems that run in a schedule and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"simulation.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ecs\/gettingstarted","role":"article","title":"Getting Started with ECS","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/ECS\/documentation\/ECS\/GettingStarted"}}}